{
  "id": "8447fd6f-8dae-4a68-9917-427eaf8f6eb0",
  "name": "孟嘗君篇·第二章 函谷雞鳴",
  "fragments": [
    {
      "id": "dd5ba5a8-de87-4b4a-97d3-ff80f5d7e7c5",
      "name": "main",
      "blocks": [
        {
          "id": "cce9c104-b63b-42b5-b95c-43b8282e014f",
          "type": "scene",
          "props": {
            "disabled": false,
            "sceneId": "ac558102-44af-4040-a3c2-710f863a80ea",
            "sceneName": "咸陽宮",
            "uri": "",
            "transitionMode": "cover",
            "transitionDuration": "800",
            "waitForComplete": "false",
            "resetCamera": "false",
            "displayType": "cover",
            "position": "(50%,50%)",
            "anchor": "center",
            "size": ""
          }
        },
        {
          "id": "f9b06c92-9895-4fd7-83b4-c9f4fd20f08d",
          "type": "sound",
          "props": {
            "disabled": false,
            "soundType": "BGM",
            "soundId": "bgm",
            "uri": "bgm/bgm_03_qin_court.mp3",
            "volume": "75",
            "loop": "true",
            "fadeDuration": ""
          }
        },
        {
          "id": "dca91852-0001-4fd8-9425-6324ecdef303",
          "type": "narration",
          "props": {
            "disabled": false,
            "keepDialogue": true,
            "voiceHash": ""
          },
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "行前，門下苦諫的人排到了府門外。有善譬喻的客給你講了個故事：土偶人與木偶人相與語。木偶人曰：天雨，子將敗矣。土偶人曰：我生於土，敗則歸土；今天雨，流子而行，未知所止息也——齊人入秦而不得出，恐為秦土上的一具木偶。",
              "styles": {}
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "id": "5770101c-8189-40fe-b2cb-65eaa8ef953b",
          "type": "narration",
          "props": {
            "disabled": false,
            "keepDialogue": true,
            "voiceHash": ""
          },
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "故事你聽懂了，也記住了。可齊王的詔命與秦王的國書疊在案頭，質子已在臨淄——這一趟，不是你想不想去，是齊國需要你去。",
              "styles": {}
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "id": "9fa6e9eb-f39c-45a9-b4e9-8daa283a5883",
          "type": "narration",
          "props": {
            "disabled": false,
            "keepDialogue": true,
            "voiceHash": ""
          },
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "齊湣王二十五年，你終於還是西行入秦了。車駕過函谷關那日，你掀簾回望——關城如鐵，夾在兩山之間，只放得下一條路。你當時不知道，這一眼，是替幾個月後的自己看的。",
              "styles": {}
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "id": "69935e61-be8d-4707-ac06-99ba0edfe930",
          "type": "narration",
          "props": {
            "disabled": false,
            "keepDialogue": true,
            "voiceHash": ""
          },
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "咸陽宮的臺階比臨淄的高。秦昭王降階相迎，執你的手入殿，滿朝文武側目——這是強秦待客從未有過的禮數。",
              "styles": {}
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "id": "716e8352-bd7b-477a-8284-d6ef9bf637e7",
          "type": "dialogue",
          "props": {
            "disabled": false,
            "characterId": "446618ca-1fda-4fe0-ab71-89a2320f1707",
            "characterName": "秦昭王",
            "expression": "平靜",
            "position": "left",
            "showCharacter": true,
            "keepCharacter": true,
            "keepDialogue": true,
            "isFirst": true,
            "isLast": true,
            "prevExpression": "",
            "voiceHash": ""
          },
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "「薛公之名，寡人聞之久矣。齊有孟嘗而秦無之，此寡人之憾也。[wait=600]寡人欲以相印屬君，君意如何？」",
              "styles": {}
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "id": "d6bb99bc-d1ba-4af7-b3b8-aa7c0e5bebd7",
          "type": "narration",
          "props": {
            "disabled": false,
            "keepDialogue": true,
            "voiceHash": ""
          },
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "相印。虎狼之秦的相印。殿上死一般地靜，你聽得見自己衣袖裡的心跳。這是潑天的榮寵，也是一口沒有底的井。",
              "styles": {}
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "id": "0c6484c3-3096-4e9e-83ec-3d25c398e417",
          "type": "branch",
          "props": {
            "disabled": false,
            "branchId": "",
            "title": "秦王以相印相屬。你——",
            "choices": "[{\"text\":\"「客卿之身，敢不效力。」受之\",\"mode\":\"jump\",\"fragmentId\":\"06f19120-3dad-4bec-878f-be469d602bed\"},{\"text\":\"「文，齊人也。相秦，恐負大王。」婉辭\",\"mode\":\"jump\",\"fragmentId\":\"da0eea7a-38f6-44e0-bcca-49aaa1aa6ae6\"},{\"text\":\"「容文思之。」拖而不決，先觀朝局\",\"mode\":\"jump\",\"fragmentId\":\"d2b1e204-2dcb-400d-bee8-43fb5ab6366d\"}]"
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "06f19120-3dad-4bec-878f-be469d602bed",
      "name": "相議-受",
      "blocks": [
        {
          "id": "200bf672-82aa-455a-b50e-56b3525a91c7",
          "type": "narration",
          "props": {
            "disabled": false,
            "keepDialogue": true,
            "voiceHash": ""
          },
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "你受了。既入虎穴，便持虎符——有相印在手，進可攬秦政，退可護己身。你開始署理政事，秦人的公文竹簡在你案頭堆成了小山。",
              "styles": {}
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "id": "67d9efb4-9791-4d91-8917-51e5a2ec0c4a",
          "type": "narration",
          "props": {
            "disabled": false,
            "keepDialogue": true,
            "voiceHash": ""
          },
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "你做得太好了。好到秦國的老世族們坐不住了——一個齊人，憑什麼站在大秦權力的頂上？",
              "styles": {}
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "id": "5005b739-b696-42f5-8587-38c0677ac42f",
          "type": "callFragment",
          "props": {
            "disabled": false,
            "fragmentId": "5d7585b7-82bd-47db-abb2-166f06369618"
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "da0eea7a-38f6-44e0-bcca-49aaa1aa6ae6",
      "name": "相議-辭",
      "blocks": [
        {
          "id": "773c767d-e0fa-4064-9672-9f7f9687509a",
          "type": "narration",
          "props": {
            "disabled": false,
            "keepDialogue": true,
            "voiceHash": ""
          },
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "你辭了。辭得謙恭得體，滴水不漏。秦昭王臉上的笑意淡了一分——強秦之王持相印與人，還從沒有人敢推回來。",
              "styles": {}
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "id": "1a30d6e4-491c-4d05-9cdc-4cfce4f86b1f",
          "type": "narration",
          "props": {
            "disabled": false,
            "keepDialogue": true,
            "voiceHash": ""
          },
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "你想以退保身，卻忘了一件事：在虎狼之庭，「不肯為我所用」四個字，比「用之不當」更犯忌諱。",
              "styles": {}
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "id": "bbf3193c-cb9c-4e22-af7b-bed1238f7d6f",
          "type": "callFragment",
          "props": {
            "disabled": false,
            "fragmentId": "5d7585b7-82bd-47db-abb2-166f06369618"
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "d2b1e204-2dcb-400d-bee8-43fb5ab6366d",
      "name": "相議-虛",
      "blocks": [
        {
          "id": "15f4acbb-bff2-45f9-939a-b153fc386086",
          "type": "narration",
          "props": {
            "disabled": false,
            "keepDialogue": true,
            "voiceHash": ""
          },
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "你既不受，也不辭，只是拖著。白日裡與秦臣周旋宴飲，夜裡遣門客四出，把咸陽的朝局一寸一寸摸過去。",
              "styles": {}
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "id": "ee241547-84d0-42d6-9313-086bfb122e6b",
          "type": "narration",
          "props": {
            "disabled": false,
            "keepDialogue": true,
            "voiceHash": ""
          },
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "七日之後你摸清了兩件事：其一，秦廷之上，忌你的人遠多過敬你的人；其二——你的門客回報，有人已經先你一步，在昭王耳邊下了種子。",
              "styles": {}
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "id": "b36ef15f-386c-4ebd-b67b-02f28cec54b0",
          "type": "callFragment",
          "props": {
            "disabled": false,
            "fragmentId": "5d7585b7-82bd-47db-abb2-166f06369618"
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "5d7585b7-82bd-47db-abb2-166f06369618",
      "name": "讒言",
      "blocks": [
        {
          "id": "3ac34c3e-3f5c-4dc6-9945-c132402c2d39",
          "type": "narration",
          "props": {
            "disabled": false,
            "keepDialogue": true,
            "voiceHash": ""
          },
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "讒言終究是來了，來得又快又準。",
              "styles": {}
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "id": "806954c9-77ad-41e2-bdfb-ad714d9c0cc7",
          "type": "dialogue",
          "props": {
            "disabled": false,
            "characterId": "08497ae5-7888-4803-816d-1e70056f8a26",
            "characterName": "秦廷近臣",
            "expression": "平靜",
            "position": "left",
            "showCharacter": true,
            "keepCharacter": true,
            "keepDialogue": true,
            "isFirst": true,
            "isLast": true,
            "prevExpression": "",
            "voiceHash": ""
          },
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "「大王。孟嘗君賢，天下莫及——然其又齊族也。今相秦，必先齊而後秦。[wait=500]秦，其危矣。」",
              "styles": {}
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "id": "ca9c5d2e-0101-4f32-b092-b216dd18d724",
          "type": "narration",
          "props": {
            "disabled": false,
            "keepDialogue": true,
            "voiceHash": ""
          },
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "先齊後秦，四個字，字字誅心。用你，是資齊；放你，是縱虎。那麼只剩下第三條路了。",
              "styles": {}
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "id": "057d1624-da7b-464b-8d73-d7b183b99ce8",
          "type": "scene",
          "props": {
            "disabled": false,
            "sceneId": "adeeb36d-5940-416f-a5ed-b9780b216c7f",
            "sceneName": "咸陽獄",
            "uri": "",
            "transitionMode": "cover",
            "transitionDuration": "600",
            "waitForComplete": "false",
            "resetCamera": "false",
            "displayType": "cover",
            "position": "(50%,50%)",
            "anchor": "center",
            "size": ""
          }
        },
        {
          "id": "b9ac3f4a-3eb8-4b23-a514-6597a89af968",
          "type": "sound",
          "props": {
            "disabled": false,
            "soundType": "BGM",
            "soundId": "bgm",
            "uri": "bgm/bgm_04_prison.mp3",
            "volume": "65",
            "loop": "true",
            "fadeDuration": ""
          }
        },
        {
          "id": "4244db36-08cd-4c79-af56-e979a61cef6e",
          "type": "narration",
          "props": {
            "disabled": false,
            "keepDialogue": true,
            "voiceHash": ""
          },
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "是夜，甲士圍館。沒有詔書，沒有罪名，你和隨行的門客被分別下獄——謀欲殺之，只差一個由頭。",
              "styles": {}
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "id": "da37857e-bc83-45c0-8dcb-a2a06abdb342",
          "type": "narration",
          "props": {
            "disabled": false,
            "keepDialogue": true,
            "voiceHash": ""
          },
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "獄中無日月。你數著牆上滲水的痕跡，第一次如此清晰地意識到：孟嘗君三個字在齊國是門楣，在咸陽的獄裡，什麼都不是。",
              "styles": {}
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "id": "66c8c852-915b-49eb-83f2-4d9a45909d40",
          "type": "narration",
          "props": {
            "disabled": false,
            "keepDialogue": true,
            "voiceHash": ""
          },
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "你想起臨行前那個土偶與木偶的故事。天真的下雨了。雨裡你才看明白門客當日沒說透的下半句：木偶被水沖走，未知所止息——沖走之前，得先有人肯下水撈。你的水裡，有人肯嗎？",
              "styles": {}
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "id": "6edc5b22-9334-4cc6-8b81-4c24bd989055",
          "type": "callFragment",
          "props": {
            "disabled": false,
            "fragmentId": "67bb5047-928f-49e4-b57f-084e8851f17c"
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "67bb5047-928f-49e4-b57f-084e8851f17c",
      "name": "求裘",
      "blocks": [
        {
          "id": "ba6969ec-5250-4ed3-a112-3e02c3c01532",
          "type": "narration",
          "props": {
            "disabled": false,
            "keepDialogue": true,
            "voiceHash": ""
          },
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "能見到你的門客，只剩下獄卒肯放進來的一兩人。你把最後的路想了一遍：秦王身邊，此刻只有一個人的話還進得去——他最寵愛的幸姬。",
              "styles": {}
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "id": "f5af15ac-b4a6-4915-a4b3-fde1988c8461",
          "type": "narration",
          "props": {
            "disabled": false,
            "keepDialogue": true,
            "voiceHash": ""
          },
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "門客輾轉抵見幸姬。她隔著簾子聽完，只說了一句話。",
              "styles": {}
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "id": "e75f95e9-aa56-4e31-a176-5034fc816a84",
          "type": "dialogue",
          "props": {
            "disabled": false,
            "characterId": "c3a4a748-b3c0-41ae-994f-2a13f6503711",
            "characterName": "幸姬",
            "expression": "微笑",
            "position": "left",
            "showCharacter": true,
            "keepCharacter": true,
            "keepDialogue": true,
            "isFirst": true,
            "isLast": true,
            "prevExpression": "",
            "voiceHash": ""
          },
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "「妾聞薛公有狐白裘，天下無雙。[wait=600]妾願得之。」",
              "styles": {}
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "id": "00a3cfb8-48ea-4678-8c40-e561e8545949",
          "type": "narration",
          "props": {
            "disabled": false,
            "keepDialogue": true,
            "voiceHash": ""
          },
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "消息帶回獄中，你閉上了眼睛。狐白裘，集百狐之腋而成，天下只此一件——入秦之日，已獻昭王，藏於秦宮深庫。更無他裘。她不是不知道這件事。她開的不是價，是一道無解的題——推得乾乾淨淨，又體面得無可指摘。",
              "styles": {}
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "id": "1ef5184d-5025-4eb3-a48a-a9ddb22f33ca",
          "type": "narration",
          "props": {
            "disabled": false,
            "keepDialogue": true,
            "voiceHash": ""
          },
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "死局。門客們面面相覷。就在這時，獄墻角落裡有個瘦小的身影慢慢站了起來——與你一同下獄的隨行客中，有他。",
              "styles": {}
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "id": "0434cd74-7639-4b09-b5ee-a730acb6fc9b",
          "type": "dialogue",
          "props": {
            "disabled": false,
            "characterId": "5d9b6311-5353-473f-a239-22c8c4861605",
            "characterName": "狗盜之徒",
            "expression": "平靜",
            "position": "left",
            "showCharacter": true,
            "keepCharacter": true,
            "keepDialogue": true,
            "isFirst": true,
            "isLast": true,
            "prevExpression": "",
            "voiceHash": ""
          },
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "「君上。[wait=500]宮牆再高，也是牆。庫門再深，也是門。小人這條命是君上收留的——這門手藝，也該當一回大用了。」",
              "styles": {}
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "id": "49289546-a354-4376-bb22-1c634613d15c",
          "type": "narration",
          "props": {
            "disabled": false,
            "keepDialogue": true,
            "voiceHash": ""
          },
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "劫秦宮。事若敗露，他必死，你也再無生理。他跪在那裡等你一句話。",
              "styles": {}
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "id": "0bac40d1-1b79-4f25-bb29-a77a1416bb8f",
          "type": "branch",
          "props": {
            "disabled": false,
            "branchId": "",
            "title": "狗盜之徒請命夜入秦宮。你——",
            "choices": "[{\"text\":\"起身，整衣，朝他長揖到地：「先生，拜託了。」\",\"mode\":\"jump\",\"fragmentId\":\"419b6978-c3ff-490b-a1de-202c140ddb71\"},{\"text\":\"「事成之日，千金為壽，上舍為居。」\",\"mode\":\"jump\",\"fragmentId\":\"496edcf9-e797-479a-a39d-5629e715927d\"},{\"text\":\"「去罷。只是——若有差池，孤不曾知有此事。」\",\"mode\":\"jump\",\"fragmentId\":\"cd167477-5e3b-4c2a-ba07-428cd3f03d85\"}]"
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "419b6978-c3ff-490b-a1de-202c140ddb71",
      "name": "託-國士",
      "blocks": [
        {
          "id": "8f8f0755-99b8-4f56-b1ef-52ba66837bfe",
          "type": "narration",
          "props": {
            "disabled": false,
            "keepDialogue": true,
            "voiceHash": ""
          },
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "你起身，整了整囚衣上的褶皺，朝著那個滿堂訕笑過的狗盜之徒，長揖到地。獄中昏暗，你看不清他的臉，只聽見他的呼吸亂了一拍。",
              "styles": {}
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "id": "6a1c4d6c-7930-4ad8-90cc-9f52b07a434a",
          "type": "dialogue",
          "props": {
            "disabled": false,
            "characterId": "5d9b6311-5353-473f-a239-22c8c4861605",
            "characterName": "狗盜之徒",
            "expression": "狡黠",
            "position": "left",
            "showCharacter": true,
            "keepCharacter": true,
            "keepDialogue": true,
            "isFirst": true,
            "isLast": true,
            "prevExpression": "",
            "voiceHash": ""
          },
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "「……君上折煞小人了。[wait=400]等小人的好消息。」",
              "styles": {}
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "id": "6c054eb5-98ef-4922-b007-398e85f5ed88",
          "type": "narration",
          "props": {
            "disabled": false,
            "keepDialogue": true,
            "voiceHash": ""
          },
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "以國士待人者，人以國士報之。那一夜他翻出獄墻的身影，輕得像一片影子落進雪裡。",
              "styles": {}
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "id": "7619e4e5-72ab-4b9f-a831-7ffd34ebe7d6",
          "type": "setver",
          "props": {
            "disabled": false,
            "key": "器量",
            "op": "+=",
            "aKind": "lit",
            "aLit": "1",
            "aVar": "",
            "bKind": "none",
            "bLit": "",
            "bVar": "",
            "binOp": "+"
          }
        },
        {
          "id": "7c4030f1-4336-46d6-8658-9edff12b284b",
          "type": "callFragment",
          "props": {
            "disabled": false,
            "fragmentId": "9f04dfd5-f454-46fa-97e8-d14cb27248a1"
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "496edcf9-e797-479a-a39d-5629e715927d",
      "name": "託-重賞",
      "blocks": [
        {
          "id": "24adca8f-fc01-4d19-8bba-1ca5c1cede48",
          "type": "narration",
          "props": {
            "disabled": false,
            "keepDialogue": true,
            "voiceHash": ""
          },
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "千金，上舍。你開出的價碼公道得無可挑剔——薛公府的規矩，功必賞，賞必厚。",
              "styles": {}
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "id": "4927d895-757f-471b-85ae-21d27de2031d",
          "type": "narration",
          "props": {
            "disabled": false,
            "keepDialogue": true,
            "voiceHash": ""
          },
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "他咧嘴一笑，應了。只是躍出獄墻前，他回頭看了你一眼，那眼神你有點讀不懂——像是想要的不是這個，又像是本來也沒指望。",
              "styles": {}
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "id": "c4d95c47-9a34-46df-bf97-d951fc3dfcbb",
          "type": "callFragment",
          "props": {
            "disabled": false,
            "fragmentId": "9f04dfd5-f454-46fa-97e8-d14cb27248a1"
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "cd167477-5e3b-4c2a-ba07-428cd3f03d85",
      "name": "託-切割",
      "blocks": [
        {
          "id": "c9cf48d6-25fc-4d05-aa93-93a27f7d7310",
          "type": "narration",
          "props": {
            "disabled": false,
            "keepDialogue": true,
            "voiceHash": ""
          },
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "你說得很輕，但獄裡每個人都聽清了：事若敗露，薛公不知有此人。這是持重——你身後是三千門客、薛地一邑，賭不起一個盜字。",
              "styles": {}
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "id": "a968ae44-4020-4d53-aca2-9aca44f8f2c2",
          "type": "narration",
          "props": {
            "disabled": false,
            "keepDialogue": true,
            "voiceHash": ""
          },
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "狗盜之徒臉上的神情沒有變。他朝你磕了個頭：「小人明白。本就是見不得光的手藝，見不得光的人。」翻墻而去的背影，比來時佝僂了一些。",
              "styles": {}
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "id": "2a873ea6-85e6-4a3a-8c20-745e5ca972df",
          "type": "setver",
          "props": {
            "disabled": false,
            "key": "器量",
            "op": "-=",
            "aKind": "lit",
            "aLit": "1",
            "aVar": "",
            "bKind": "none",
            "bLit": "",
            "bVar": "",
            "binOp": "+"
          }
        },
        {
          "id": "f42de7f7-1ebd-4290-8919-bec697a6f0fc",
          "type": "callFragment",
          "props": {
            "disabled": false,
            "fragmentId": "9f04dfd5-f454-46fa-97e8-d14cb27248a1"
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "9f04dfd5-f454-46fa-97e8-d14cb27248a1",
      "name": "盜裘",
      "blocks": [
        {
          "id": "e98b6a4b-3c4d-4b4c-9f8c-06a29dcef2b8",
          "type": "narration",
          "props": {
            "disabled": false,
            "keepDialogue": true,
            "voiceHash": ""
          },
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "後半夜落了雪。秦宮的犬吠了兩聲，又安靜下去——巡夜的衛士只當是狗在應狗。沒有人低頭去看：牆根的陰影裡，一件狗裘正貼著地面游過庭院，避開每一盞燈籠的光圈，熟門熟路，彷彿在自家院裡走了半輩子。",
              "styles": {}
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "id": "6cf6e679-305a-44de-9ed8-bf87047d1205",
          "type": "narration",
          "props": {
            "disabled": false,
            "keepDialogue": true,
            "voiceHash": ""
          },
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "秦宮庫房的鎖，號稱天下最牢。天亮之後庫吏交割，簿冊分毫不差，門鎖完好如初——只有裘架上空了一格。這樁無頭案，秦廷上下追查了一個月，最後只能記作：狐妖夜遁。",
              "styles": {}
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "id": "90d6e1ca-0e06-408d-a6c7-70070b35b80b",
          "type": "narration",
          "props": {
            "disabled": false,
            "keepDialogue": true,
            "voiceHash": ""
          },
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "天亮之前，那件天下無雙的狐白裘，已經擱在了幸姬的妝臺上，帶著宮庫深處的樟腦氣和一身寒雪。幸姬撫著裘上的雪白狐腋，當夜就在昭王枕邊，替一個齊國人說了話。",
              "styles": {}
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "id": "17b7d56d-5dc1-4b35-a775-a804efb1fe28",
          "type": "narration",
          "props": {
            "disabled": false,
            "keepDialogue": true,
            "voiceHash": ""
          },
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "沒有人知道她說了什麼。只知道第二日清晨，釋放孟嘗君的令符出了宮門。",
              "styles": {}
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "id": "34ba9931-fe72-4565-82e0-b5a401ff6aaf",
          "type": "narration",
          "props": {
            "disabled": false,
            "keepDialogue": true,
            "voiceHash": ""
          },
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "你們沒有等第二道令符。出獄即馳，更封傳，變名姓——薛公孟嘗君死在了咸陽的名冊上，活下來的是一隊不起眼的商旅，沿著馳道向東，亡命而去。",
              "styles": {}
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "id": "071ed8fb-64c6-48db-8a4a-1293cee409e4",
          "type": "callFragment",
          "props": {
            "disabled": false,
            "fragmentId": "58e19172-e602-4128-b5d5-db4c751f87a7"
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "58e19172-e602-4128-b5d5-db4c751f87a7",
      "name": "岔路",
      "blocks": [
        {
          "id": "9dc6b43f-fd42-4a27-9d0a-3b07f7a766c8",
          "type": "scene",
          "props": {
            "disabled": false,
            "sceneId": "7cf5fc1c-b469-4ac6-9120-0e8b068b0758",
            "sceneName": "荒野驛道",
            "uri": "",
            "transitionMode": "cover",
            "transitionDuration": "600",
            "waitForComplete": "false",
            "resetCamera": "false",
            "displayType": "cover",
            "position": "(50%,50%)",
            "anchor": "center",
            "size": ""
          }
        },
        {
          "id": "fe7725a6-6746-4ae4-a08e-42aeb8cea851",
          "type": "narration",
          "props": {
            "disabled": false,
            "keepDialogue": true,
            "voiceHash": ""
          },
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "出咸陽三百里，天黑透了。馳道在此分岔：一條寬整，直而近；一條窄舊，繞山而行。車隊停在岔口，門客們爭執不下——追兵若發，必循大道；可小道年久，據說早已坍毀難行。",
              "styles": {}
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "id": "11d2abbf-304e-4720-be3e-32f8194460ed",
          "type": "narration",
          "props": {
            "disabled": false,
            "keepDialogue": true,
            "voiceHash": ""
          },
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "道旁的殘垣下坐著一個乞丐，裹著一件看不出顏色的破氅，就著雪光，慢條斯理地啃一塊乾餅——彷彿在這荒野裡坐了很久，專等著看你們爭執似的。",
              "styles": {}
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "id": "4d38a3c0-54a6-49c1-8f12-0dff0429808a",
          "type": "dialogue",
          "props": {
            "disabled": false,
            "characterId": "3d4b61a7-0798-40cf-813f-6c59551c12c3",
            "characterName": "道旁乞丐",
            "expression": "平靜",
            "position": "left",
            "showCharacter": true,
            "keepCharacter": true,
            "keepDialogue": true,
            "isFirst": true,
            "isLast": true,
            "prevExpression": "",
            "voiceHash": ""
          },
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "「客人們是往東去罷。[wait=600]大道快，是快到函谷；小道慢，是慢到函谷。——只看客人們，是想快著死，還是慢著活了。」",
              "styles": {}
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "id": "8739db63-16be-4779-92b1-45230a96b23a",
          "type": "narration",
          "props": {
            "disabled": false,
            "keepDialogue": true,
            "voiceHash": ""
          },
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "語焉不詳，偏又字字在點上。門客中有人斥他胡言，有人卻悚然而驚：追兵循大道，正是「快著死」。",
              "styles": {}
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "id": "07e406d0-4bbc-4177-807f-12febf902042",
          "type": "branch",
          "props": {
            "disabled": false,
            "branchId": "",
            "title": "乞丐之言，信或不信。你——",
            "choices": "[{\"text\":\"依言取小道。臨行擲下一囊金——你多看了那人一眼\",\"mode\":\"jump\",\"fragmentId\":\"4a0de525-6c4e-4718-970e-690ab0d89b11\"},{\"text\":\"疑其為秦人耳目，故意反其道，取大道疾馳\",\"mode\":\"jump\",\"fragmentId\":\"ec6b0bbe-75ea-4a75-b434-5ca53687a42d\"},{\"text\":\"依言取小道，趕路要緊，無暇他顧\",\"mode\":\"jump\",\"fragmentId\":\"dbd920d6-43bc-4652-9d99-d259e1623f4a\"}]"
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "4a0de525-6c4e-4718-970e-690ab0d89b11",
      "name": "岔路-留意",
      "blocks": [
        {
          "id": "b20d7a32-0a98-4598-a65e-dabc1ba41a07",
          "type": "narration",
          "props": {
            "disabled": false,
            "keepDialogue": true,
            "voiceHash": ""
          },
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "你命人取小道，臨行解下一囊金，親手擲到那乞丐膝前。他沒有謝，只抬手把金囊往懷裡一攏——就在那破氅掀動的一瞬，你看見他腰間橫著一柄劍。",
              "styles": {}
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "id": "23a39def-6d40-4ff4-bc7c-1e3eda0e0a24",
          "type": "narration",
          "props": {
            "disabled": false,
            "keepDialogue": true,
            "voiceHash": ""
          },
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "乞丐佩劍，已是奇事。更奇的是那劍鞘：木色深舊，鞘口卻嵌著一枚小小的銅紋——雲雷紋裡盤一個「工」字。你見過這紋樣。薛地的老鑄坊，打出的器物都烙這個記號。",
              "styles": {}
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "id": "898d6fcd-9947-4c5e-b767-8ab1c3040478",
          "type": "narration",
          "props": {
            "disabled": false,
            "keepDialogue": true,
            "voiceHash": ""
          },
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "薛地的劍，怎麼會躺在秦國荒驛的一個乞丐腰上？你正要再看，車已起行，那人影連同殘垣一起退進了夜色裡。這個念頭在你心裡打了一個結——往後很多年，都沒有解開。",
              "styles": {}
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "id": "f7eb6182-db37-49a8-ae39-06aab23ef2c3",
          "type": "setver",
          "props": {
            "disabled": false,
            "key": "留意劍鞘紋",
            "op": "=",
            "aKind": "lit",
            "aLit": "1",
            "aVar": "",
            "bKind": "none",
            "bLit": "",
            "bVar": "",
            "binOp": "+"
          }
        },
        {
          "id": "89c372be-e825-46e3-a5e9-a6169f928003",
          "type": "callFragment",
          "props": {
            "disabled": false,
            "fragmentId": "a2c44ea3-3b93-4cf8-864a-3b04142ff17a"
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "ec6b0bbe-75ea-4a75-b434-5ca53687a42d",
      "name": "岔路-疑心",
      "blocks": [
        {
          "id": "815bce5a-8e70-445c-b999-a00b7413b114",
          "type": "narration",
          "props": {
            "disabled": false,
            "keepDialogue": true,
            "voiceHash": ""
          },
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "荒野之中安坐一人，專候你們車隊——太巧了。你斷其為秦人布下的耳目，反其道而行，取大道疾馳。",
              "styles": {}
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "id": "b992e9ae-0fde-430e-a334-0422a57ba5f4",
          "type": "narration",
          "props": {
            "disabled": false,
            "keepDialogue": true,
            "voiceHash": ""
          },
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "大道果然平整，車行如飛。可行不到百里，前方驛站燈火通明，人喊馬嘶——是換馬的驛卒在整備，為身後而來的什麼人清道。你的車隊摸黑繞驛而過，多耗了半夜，驚出一身冷汗。回望來路，你忽然想起那句「快著死」。",
              "styles": {}
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "id": "7a9c9608-c148-4fb9-8d07-3e51d5b72409",
          "type": "callFragment",
          "props": {
            "disabled": false,
            "fragmentId": "a2c44ea3-3b93-4cf8-864a-3b04142ff17a"
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "dbd920d6-43bc-4652-9d99-d259e1623f4a",
      "name": "岔路-趕路",
      "blocks": [
        {
          "id": "be837bcf-f616-4f1b-9a68-5707d23fd831",
          "type": "narration",
          "props": {
            "disabled": false,
            "keepDialogue": true,
            "voiceHash": ""
          },
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "生死關頭，一句瘋話也是話。你命人取小道。車輪碾過殘雪，把那乞丐和他的破氅遠遠拋在身後——你始終沒有回頭再看一眼。",
              "styles": {}
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "id": "e8cb6c9b-ca45-4811-b431-c195f3343631",
          "type": "narration",
          "props": {
            "disabled": false,
            "keepDialogue": true,
            "voiceHash": ""
          },
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "小道舊而不毀，繞山而行，竟比想的好走得多。彷彿……有人早把塌方的土石清開過。這個念頭一閃即逝——趕路的人，顧不上想這些。",
              "styles": {}
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "id": "f25610cb-4cd5-4aed-8216-b7b8f9154e5e",
          "type": "callFragment",
          "props": {
            "disabled": false,
            "fragmentId": "a2c44ea3-3b93-4cf8-864a-3b04142ff17a"
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "a2c44ea3-3b93-4cf8-864a-3b04142ff17a",
      "name": "函谷",
      "blocks": [
        {
          "id": "76267570-5819-4568-b079-8bb500358b4a",
          "type": "scene",
          "props": {
            "disabled": false,
            "sceneId": "814f1a0f-6e6c-4bdc-b95c-8183b4dc95fb",
            "sceneName": "函谷關",
            "uri": "",
            "transitionMode": "cover",
            "transitionDuration": "600",
            "waitForComplete": "false",
            "resetCamera": "false",
            "displayType": "cover",
            "position": "(50%,50%)",
            "anchor": "center",
            "size": ""
          }
        },
        {
          "id": "a3e99f6a-a55b-4d8f-8b78-0b804f509ffa",
          "type": "sound",
          "props": {
            "disabled": false,
            "soundType": "BGM",
            "soundId": "bgm",
            "uri": "bgm/bgm_05_hangu_pass.mp3",
            "volume": "70",
            "loop": "true",
            "fadeDuration": ""
          }
        },
        {
          "id": "f46861c1-4577-40b7-8f59-61b4b6968cad",
          "type": "narration",
          "props": {
            "disabled": false,
            "keepDialogue": true,
            "voiceHash": ""
          },
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "夜半，函谷關。",
              "styles": {}
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "id": "8c0b1c56-d3b9-412b-bd95-1124c6230d58",
          "type": "narration",
          "props": {
            "disabled": false,
            "keepDialogue": true,
            "voiceHash": ""
          },
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "關城黑沉沉地壓在兩山之間，城門閉死。秦法：雞鳴而出客。離天亮還有兩個多時辰。",
              "styles": {}
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "id": "8b56f353-f934-404d-8e7a-d31f5478a7f3",
          "type": "narration",
          "props": {
            "disabled": false,
            "keepDialogue": true,
            "voiceHash": ""
          },
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "而你們的身後，咸陽的方向，秦昭王已經醒過味來了——放走孟嘗君，等於放齊國的利刃歸鞘。悔悟的追騎正沿著馳道撒開，換馬不換人，晝夜兼程。你算得出來：天亮之前，他們必至。",
              "styles": {}
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "id": "76a5e2be-c59e-4228-904f-1aad9ea744c1",
          "type": "narration",
          "props": {
            "disabled": false,
            "keepDialogue": true,
            "voiceHash": ""
          },
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "關下客棧擠著十幾撥等開關的商旅。你的門客們聚在車邊，聲音壓得極低。兩個多時辰——等，是等死；不等，怎麼辦？",
              "styles": {}
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "id": "d5aff518-be9b-4e50-9f73-8fd81268d733",
          "type": "branch",
          "props": {
            "disabled": false,
            "branchId": "",
            "title": "關門死閉，追騎在後。你——",
            "choices": "[{\"text\":\"重金賄關吏，求他提前開門\",\"mode\":\"jump\",\"fragmentId\":\"514da96d-71a0-4183-a801-a6e93e485536\"},{\"text\":\"棄車，分散人馬，混入商旅藏匿待旦\",\"mode\":\"jump\",\"fragmentId\":\"ca5760d2-6b0e-4718-8db7-dcb0cbdaf4b8\"},{\"text\":\"召集門客：「誰有辦法，此刻就說。」\",\"mode\":\"jump\",\"fragmentId\":\"9834b8c8-39aa-4585-806d-dd4da02c8d13\"}]"
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "514da96d-71a0-4183-a801-a6e93e485536",
      "name": "關-賄吏",
      "blocks": [
        {
          "id": "03974fbf-576d-4b48-b9ad-3de302351988",
          "type": "narration",
          "props": {
            "disabled": false,
            "keepDialogue": true,
            "voiceHash": ""
          },
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "你取出百金，遣舌辯之客去尋守關的吏目。金子在秦國的分量，你在咸陽見識過。",
              "styles": {}
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "id": "44051dc1-5935-43cb-91e6-16e422aab323",
          "type": "narration",
          "props": {
            "disabled": false,
            "keepDialogue": true,
            "voiceHash": ""
          },
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "可這一回不靈。關吏看著案上的金子，手都在抖，卻死死搖頭：秦法，雞鳴而出客；擅開關門者，腰斬，家人籍沒。「客人便是拿一座金山來，小人的腰，也只有一條。」",
              "styles": {}
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "id": "7dcc4a0b-8d94-4aaa-be0d-383b0ba0f583",
          "type": "narration",
          "props": {
            "disabled": false,
            "keepDialogue": true,
            "voiceHash": ""
          },
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "金子收回來了，時辰卻賠進去半個。就在你一籌莫展之際，下坐的門客群裡，忽然有人自己站了出來。",
              "styles": {}
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "id": "5992c471-c7d3-4f07-991d-09f5be885ec4",
          "type": "callFragment",
          "props": {
            "disabled": false,
            "fragmentId": "b7428608-3a8c-40c0-b7d3-e0b476ccf739"
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "ca5760d2-6b0e-4718-8db7-dcb0cbdaf4b8",
      "name": "關-藏匿",
      "blocks": [
        {
          "id": "b3f43476-146b-41d0-aed5-4d815574d702",
          "type": "narration",
          "props": {
            "disabled": false,
            "keepDialogue": true,
            "voiceHash": ""
          },
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "你下令棄車分散，人馬拆作七八撥，混進商旅堆裡。薛公的儀仗變作馱夫的行囊，你自己裹上一件羊皮襖，蹲在騾馬糞味裡，聽著自己的心跳等天亮。",
              "styles": {}
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "id": "c07c1a2b-df09-4c74-9d92-22244911d3df",
          "type": "narration",
          "props": {
            "disabled": false,
            "keepDialogue": true,
            "voiceHash": ""
          },
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "可追騎要抓的不是車駕，是人。名冊上你們一行幾口、什麼年貌，咸陽寫得清清楚楚——關門一開，挨個過所盤驗，藏是藏不過去的。門客中有人低聲把這層捅破，眾人的臉一齊白了。",
              "styles": {}
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "id": "5e2c5fc2-4fb3-4fd0-905e-8a4bc84dcf99",
          "type": "narration",
          "props": {
            "disabled": false,
            "keepDialogue": true,
            "voiceHash": ""
          },
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "就在這時，下坐的門客群裡，忽然有人自己站了出來。",
              "styles": {}
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "id": "3a9242f5-7f83-4006-ad6f-37f80d0acd41",
          "type": "callFragment",
          "props": {
            "disabled": false,
            "fragmentId": "b7428608-3a8c-40c0-b7d3-e0b476ccf739"
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "9834b8c8-39aa-4585-806d-dd4da02c8d13",
      "name": "關-問客",
      "blocks": [
        {
          "id": "92eb423f-1b4c-4936-92fe-7089029bbf11",
          "type": "narration",
          "props": {
            "disabled": false,
            "keepDialogue": true,
            "voiceHash": ""
          },
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "你把門客召到車後，一字一句：「文之性命，諸君之性命，皆在這兩個時辰裡。誰有辦法，此刻就說——無論那是什麼辦法。」",
              "styles": {}
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "id": "5db3d7cb-cab9-4bdb-b248-0d17b06805a1",
          "type": "narration",
          "props": {
            "disabled": false,
            "keepDialogue": true,
            "voiceHash": ""
          },
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "無論那是什麼辦法。這句話說出口，下坐的門客群裡安靜了一瞬——然後，有人自己站了出來。",
              "styles": {}
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "id": "156088e4-b245-4cb7-8e88-70573f7c8274",
          "type": "callFragment",
          "props": {
            "disabled": false,
            "fragmentId": "b7428608-3a8c-40c0-b7d3-e0b476ccf739"
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b7428608-3a8c-40c0-b7d3-e0b476ccf739",
      "name": "雞鳴",
      "blocks": [
        {
          "id": "7deebb57-a77d-4d20-b0b3-f15fe78d2947",
          "type": "narration",
          "props": {
            "disabled": false,
            "keepDialogue": true,
            "voiceHash": ""
          },
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "是個一直縮在最末尾的客人，瘦長個子，來投時自陳的本事曾讓滿堂笑了半日——他說他學什麼像什麼，尤其是，學雞。",
              "styles": {}
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "id": "ad935dec-2af3-4561-b474-8b7ddffdaf89",
          "type": "sound",
          "props": {
            "disabled": false,
            "soundType": "SE",
            "soundId": "",
            "uri": "se/se_rooster_crow.mp3",
            "volume": "95",
            "loop": "false",
            "fadeDuration": ""
          }
        },
        {
          "id": "7ee84cd8-c16a-4566-954e-f20509dd034b",
          "type": "narration",
          "props": {
            "disabled": false,
            "keepDialogue": true,
            "voiceHash": ""
          },
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "他朝你一拱手，沒等你答話，攏起雙掌，仰頸——一聲雞啼，破空而起。",
              "styles": {}
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "id": "b2ce213f-78a9-47dd-8bcf-5a2c465a2f0e",
          "type": "scene",
          "props": {
            "disabled": false,
            "sceneId": "b1b79cfd-549e-4bbd-8b3c-e1d56f3756a2",
            "sceneName": "CG·函谷雞鳴",
            "uri": "",
            "transitionMode": "fade",
            "transitionDuration": "500",
            "waitForComplete": "false",
            "resetCamera": "false",
            "displayType": "cover",
            "position": "(50%,50%)",
            "anchor": "center",
            "size": ""
          }
        },
        {
          "id": "0015ae92-1faa-44d2-85f0-638f06e5ede9",
          "type": "narration",
          "props": {
            "disabled": false,
            "keepDialogue": true,
            "voiceHash": ""
          },
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "那啼聲高亢嘹亮，抑揚頓挫，活脫脫就是村頭第一隻醒得最早的雄雞。一聲未落，關下客棧的雞籠裡撲稜稜一陣騷動——第二聲、第三聲，遠遠近近，關內關外，所有的雞都跟著叫了起來。",
              "styles": {}
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "id": "4a0a6e47-6654-4e6d-a1a7-906c155a67ca",
          "type": "narration",
          "props": {
            "disabled": false,
            "keepDialogue": true,
            "voiceHash": ""
          },
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "雞盡鳴。關樓上燈火次第亮起，吏卒睡眼惺忪地推開了城門——秦法：雞鳴而出客。法沒有錯，錯的是雞。",
              "styles": {}
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "id": "025d0690-4692-405d-820f-a0ba251d3aab",
          "type": "narration",
          "props": {
            "disabled": false,
            "keepDialogue": true,
            "voiceHash": ""
          },
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "驗傳，放行。城門在你們身後緩緩闔上。出關不過一頓飯的工夫，函谷關的方向煙塵大作——秦國的追騎到了關下，得到的回報是：孟嘗君已出關，去遠矣。",
              "styles": {}
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "id": "d2582db8-99d3-4af0-a980-4ecc8e0dbe29",
          "type": "scene",
          "props": {
            "disabled": false,
            "sceneId": "814f1a0f-6e6c-4bdc-b95c-8183b4dc95fb",
            "sceneName": "函谷關",
            "uri": "",
            "transitionMode": "fade",
            "transitionDuration": "500",
            "waitForComplete": "false",
            "resetCamera": "false",
            "displayType": "cover",
            "position": "(50%,50%)",
            "anchor": "center",
            "size": ""
          }
        },
        {
          "id": "b9507c41-88d1-4590-a618-932194f20646",
          "type": "callFragment",
          "props": {
            "disabled": false,
            "fragmentId": "1f80f1c7-45b5-43e6-b1d8-6e4120c9992b"
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "1f80f1c7-45b5-43e6-b1d8-6e4120c9992b",
      "name": "出關",
      "blocks": [
        {
          "id": "43633cdd-4e88-427a-a507-2a8459da6917",
          "type": "narration",
          "props": {
            "disabled": false,
            "keepDialogue": true,
            "voiceHash": ""
          },
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "追騎悻悻而還。東方既白，你在馬上回望函谷——關城如鐵，夾在兩山之間，只放得下一條路。來時你看它是雄關，去時你看它是鬼門。",
              "styles": {}
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "id": "de4c8635-d275-4814-90f1-dbafac3b3cb5",
          "type": "narration",
          "props": {
            "disabled": false,
            "keepDialogue": true,
            "voiceHash": ""
          },
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "歸途之上，一車人沉默了很久。當初雞鳴狗盜之徒入門，賓客盡羞之，恥與同列；及有秦難，卒此二人拔之。回到薛地那日，你把兩人請上了正堂上席——這一回，滿堂沒有一個人笑。",
              "styles": {}
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "id": "92107528-98cd-43bd-b103-d298e53ff0f4",
          "type": "narration",
          "props": {
            "disabled": false,
            "keepDialogue": true,
            "voiceHash": ""
          },
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "自是之後，客皆服。而你比從前更加確信：門下無廢人，只有還沒到時候的人。你把府門開得更大了。",
              "styles": {}
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "id": "378ccd4d-ff4a-4156-ad6c-6a3ce176e3b6",
          "type": "narration",
          "props": {
            "disabled": false,
            "keepDialogue": true,
            "voiceHash": ""
          },
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "只是夜深人靜時，你偶爾會想起咸陽獄的水痕、幸姬的簾影、還有荒驛雪地裡那個道破生死的乞丐。你這條命，是被多少雙看不見的手，從虎口裡一節一節拽回來的？[wait=800]你數不清。有一雙，此刻正朝著薛地，不緊不慢地走來。",
              "styles": {}
            }
          ]
        }
      ]
    }
  ]
}
